To run a simulation:
====================
source env.sh
cd sim

Siemens:
========
Compile:
make compile_mux

Simulate in command mode:
make run test_name=mux_demo_test

Cadence:
========
Compile:
make compile_mux tool=Cadence

Simulate in command mode:
make run test_name=mux_demo_test tool=Cadence

